[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0524","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0524.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0670","title":"CVSWeb 1.80 Perl open 函数远程代码执行漏洞","description":"CVSWeb 1.80 存在不安全的 Perl `open()` 函数调用漏洞。该函数在处理用户输入时未对管道符 `|` 进行过滤，远程攻击者可通过向 `open()` 传入特制参数执行任意系统命令。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞，成功利用可完全控制目标服务器。该漏洞影响 CVSWeb 1.80 及可能更早版本，已有公开的 Exploit-DB 利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0670"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-12T00:00:00Z","updated":"2000-07-12T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 CVSWeb 到 1.86 或更高版本以修复不安全的 perl open 函数调用。如无法立即升级，可临时卸载 cvsweb 或在 Web 服务器配置中限制 cvsweb.cgi 仅对可信用户开放访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20073","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/93bf7691fc17bf58197ad166ee362b4808566d7c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0670.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0670.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0670","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0670.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0670.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9382985b1487c13b41847f6783f502ebface6ca6/2000/CVE-2000-0670.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c8205feda508d733c873e4904e8ec7780820d9e3/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0670.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/4aa573a753d6387eff023ebcf6fc6297b912048e/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0670.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0670.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0670.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0524.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0524.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0524.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0791","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0791.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0654","title":"Microsoft Enterprise Manager DTS密码泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft Enterprise Manager 的数据转换服务（DTS）包中的\"已注册服务器对话框\"存在密码泄露漏洞。本地用户可通过访问该对话框界面，以明文形式获取数据库连接密码。该漏洞需要攻击者具有本地系统访问权限，属于本地提权类漏洞，影响 Microsoft SQL Server 7.0 及 SQL Server 2000 等版本。攻击者可利用获取的数据库密码进一步扩大系统访问权限，对数据的机密性和完整性构成威胁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0654"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:11Z","remediation":"升级至 Microsoft SQL Server 7.0 Service Pack 2（SP2）或更高版本，该补丁已修复 DTS 包中密码明文存储问题。如无法立即升级，限制对 Enterprise Manager 工具和 DTS 包文件的本地访问权限，仅授权管理员可登录服务器操作；避免在 DTS 包中保存密码，改为每次执行时手动输入。同时审查并移除已存在的 DTS 包中硬编码凭据。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1466","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-041","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4582","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1842f861696b8e0d2a79b27d77e1bfea36333d86/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0654.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0654","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/da07cb97146d03883b70ca493bde18a430b683ac/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0654.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9fb6bc21273092ff8b91677561ee0f67b063fcda/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0654.json","https://github.com/dependency-check/DependencyCheck/blob/797a0a07abd34902460662a11cdad773c22543c8/core/src/main/resources/dependencycheck-base-suppression.xml","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0654.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0654.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0654.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0791.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0788","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0788.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0650","title":"McAfee VirusScan/NetShield 注册表权限不当本地代码执行漏洞","description":"McAfee VirusScan 4.5 与 NetShield 4.5 默认安装时，标识 AutoUpgrade 目录的注册表项权限配置不当，本地用户可将该目录下的 SETUP.EXE 替换为木马程序。当系统执行自动升级相关流程时，会以较高权限运行被替换的程序，从而实现任意命令执行。该漏洞仅影响本地攻击场景，攻击者需具备目标主机本地访问权限且无需额外认证，主要破坏完整性。CVSS 评分为 2.1，危害等级较低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0650"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:11Z","remediation":"升级 McAfee VirusScan/NetShield 至 4.5 之后已修复权限问题的版本，或更换为当前受支持的终端防护产品。若暂无法升级，以管理员身份用 regedt32 打开注册表，找到标识 AutoUpgrade 目录的键（通常在 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Network Associates 或 McAfee 相关路径下），取消 Everyone/Users 的写权限，仅保留 Administrators 与 SYSTEM 的完全控制；同时对 AutoUpgrade 目录本身设置同样 ACL，禁止普通用户写入或替换 SETUP.EXE，并定期校验该目录下安装程序的完整性与数字签名。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ntbugtraq.com/default.asp?pid=36&sid=1&A2=ind0007&L=ntbugtraq&F=&S=&P=2753","http://www.osvdb.org/1458","http://www.osvdb.org/4200","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1458","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5177","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cc838d0e5ff34a3026c5292897b23b79aee8bacf/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0650.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0650","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/47b3b393e16caede3350b5302035c4ef73c36bc7/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0650.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0f7d9238ba77f900663100d40113352eb3a480d7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0650.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8fd24b26179bcdde52e301aef6d16b0838932c28/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-25pv-5r6h-55j6/GHSA-25pv-5r6h-55j6.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0650.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0650.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e0b785d0-9396-4122-8fa8-a7b2a08d145e.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/787307d8f336e6ebb0a4fd6310308cb7416de3d4/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0788.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0760","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0760.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0628","title":"Apache软件基金会 Apache::ASP 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"Apache::ASP模块1.93及更早版本中的source.asp示例脚本存在任意文件写入漏洞，由于脚本未对用户输入进行充分验证，远程攻击者可通过构造恶意请求向服务器写入或修改任意文件。该漏洞影响Apache::ASP 1.93及更早版本，CVSS评分7.5（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），攻击向量为网络远程攻击，无需身份认证，攻击复杂度低，可导致机密性、完整性、可用性部分受损。攻击者可利用source.asp脚本的文件写入功能上传WebShell或篡改关键文件，进而控制Web服务器。Apache Software Foundation已发布修复版本，建议升级至Apache::ASP 1.94及以上版本并删除或限制示例脚本访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0628"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:08Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Apache::ASP 模块至 1.94 或更高版本，或删除/禁用 Apache::ASP 安装目录下的 source.asp 示例脚本。如暂时无法升级，可在 Apache 配置中移除或限制对 source.asp 的访问权限（如 <Files \"source.asp\"> Require all denied </Files>），并检查 Web 目录写入权限，确保 Web 进程无写权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0142.html","http://www.nodeworks.com/asp/changes.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1457","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4931","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0628.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0628","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/56ecbe5708e7172ccdeffde501e0321bbd31bea6/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0628.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5acf8b684d0e9ea76142eea6cd4851531d4ab2af/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0628.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9mpp-c9vq-p5h7/GHSA-9mpp-c9vq-p5h7.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/apache_source_asp.nasl","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/9c64290b74a702cc2cb0f57d040036009e789093/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/ivanitlearning/CTF-Repos/blob/b5364388a861fc7457409d494a9d075d73e7867e/Vulnhub/SkyTower/Web-scan.txt","https://github.com/slacker247/GPDA/blob/fa9006d0877a691f1ddffe88799c844a3e8a669a/Sodi/Run/IDSrules/rule.1125","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0760.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0760.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0760.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0523","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0523.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0669","title":"Novell NetWare 5.0 SMDR.NLM 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Novell NetWare 5.0 的 SMDR.NLM 服务在处理 UDP 40193 端口的入站数据时存在缺陷，未对输入数据进行有效性校验。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标端口发送大量随机数据，导致服务崩溃或拒绝响应，从而使 NetWare 文件与打印服务不可用。该漏洞攻击条件简单、影响范围限于服务器可用性，CVSS 评分为 5.0，属于中等危害等级。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0669"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:13Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停止支持的 Novell NetWare 5.0/6.0，厂商不再提供安全补丁。建议立即升级到受支持的服务器操作系统（如 SUSE Linux Enterprise Server）。临时缓解措施：在防火墙上阻止外部对 UDP/TCP 40193 端口的访问，并在 NetWare 服务器上禁用 IPX 兼容模式（通过 MONITOR.NLM 或 INETCFG.NLM 关闭 IPX 协议绑定）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1467","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=000501bfeab5%249330c3d0%24d801a8c0%40dimuthu.baysidegrp.com.au","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20072","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0669.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0669.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0669","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0669.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0669.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/4aa573a753d6387eff023ebcf6fc6297b912048e/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0669.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9382985b1487c13b41847f6783f502ebface6ca6/2000/CVE-2000-0669.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c8205feda508d733c873e4904e8ec7780820d9e3/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0669.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0669.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0669.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0523.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0499","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0499.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0648","title":"Texas Imperial Software WFTPD 2.4.1 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Texas Imperial Software 开发的 WFTPD 及 WFTPD Pro 2.41 版本存在拒绝服务漏洞。本地攻击者可在未执行 RENAME FROM（RNFR）命令的情况下，直接发送 RENAME TO（RNTO）命令，触发 FTP 服务器处理异常，导致服务崩溃。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证即可利用，影响服务器可用性。目前已存在公开的 PoC 利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0648"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:11Z","remediation":"建议升级 WFTPD/WFTPD Pro 至 2.41 RC10 之后的版本，该版本已修复未先执行 RNFR 直接执行 RNTO 导致服务崩溃的问题。由于该软件已停止维护多年，建议迁移至仍受支持的 FTP 服务器软件（如 FileZilla Server 或 vsftpd）。临时缓解措施：限制 FTP 服务的访问来源 IP，仅允许受信任用户连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1456","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=E13BvU6-0007d8-00%40dwarf.box.sk","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20069","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cc838d0e5ff34a3026c5292897b23b79aee8bacf/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0648.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0648","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/47b3b393e16caede3350b5302035c4ef73c36bc7/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0648.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0f7d9238ba77f900663100d40113352eb3a480d7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0648.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisori