TNEF 附件，或在沙箱/容器环境中解压 TNEF 文件，并确保运行 tnef 的用户权限最小化（不使用 root 运行）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vendor/2000-q3/0002.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1450","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0614.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0614","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2000/CVE-2000-0614/README.md","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0614.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb772dcb04525a1a88049530e1b1081f8633cb88/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0614.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vxp6-2m83-3w8p/GHSA-vxp6-2m83-3w8p.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1450/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0614.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1314.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1314.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1314.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0803","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0803.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0661","title":"WircSrv IRC Server 5.07s 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"WircSrv IRC Server 5.07s 存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向服务器端口发送超长字符串，可触发缓冲区异常导致 IRC 服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 WircSrv IRC Server 5.07s 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。由于该产品已停止维护，建议用户迁移至其他活跃维护的 IRC 服务器软件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0661"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:12Z","remediation":"WircSrv IRC Server 5.07s 已停止维护，官方不再发布补丁。建议立即迁移至活跃维护的 IRC 服务器软件（如 UnrealIRCd 6.x 或 InspIRCd 3.x）。若无法迁移，可在防火墙或反向代理层面限制单连接最大输入长度（如 iptables 配合 string 模块过滤超长请求），并在服务端口前部署 IPS 规则拦截异常长度数据包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0120.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1448","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4914","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8ab396be03b208767ce22804ad16877ccef3b54c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0661.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0661","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/050a55b80525b99be98f5c84fe46fa8ac25be676/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0661.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2407e523ae413438625300667710835348/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0661.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7b437709e7540c8c9af0a3ecc5a6f3df80f4ff33/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xhq3-46hw-hr5h/GHSA-xhq3-46hw-hr5h.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0661.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--74917a6e-3fbf-4bf9-899a-704b0545bbf6.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0803.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0721","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0721.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0605","title":"Blackboard CourseInfo 4.0 明文管理员密码漏洞","description":"Blackboard CourseInfo 4.0 存在敏感信息明文存储漏洞，系统将本地管理员和 SQL 数据库管理员的用户名及密码以明文形式保存在注册表项中，且该注册表项的访问控制权限设置不当，允许普通用户读取其中的敏感凭据信息。本地攻击者可通过登录系统后直接访问该注册表项获取管理员密码，进而提升权限或访问后端数据库，对系统安全构成严重威胁。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0605"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-10T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:05Z","remediation":"立即限制注册表项 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Blackboard\\CourseInfo 的访问权限，仅允许 SYSTEM 和管理员读取；升级到 Blackboard 后续版本（5.0 及以上），该版本已改用加密方式存储凭据；如无法升级，使用 regedit 将相关注册表项的权限设置为仅 Administrators 可读。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ntbugtraq.com/default.asp?pid=36&sid=1&A2=ind0007&L=NTBUGTRAQ&P=R1647","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1460","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0605.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0605","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0605.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0605.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hv99-5fhv-j4mj/GHSA-hv99-5fhv-j4mj.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0605.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe