份。该漏洞允许远程未经身份认证的攻击者实施用户冒充，影响 Novell BorderManager 软件的相关版本，CVSS 评分为 7.5，危害等级为高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0651"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:11Z","remediation":"升级 Novell BorderManager 至最新补丁版本，限制对 TCP 3024 端口的访问仅允许受信任的内部网络 IP，在防火墙上添加规则阻止外部对 3024 端口的访问。如产品已停止支持，建议迁移至 Micro Focus 当前支持的替代产品，并启用加密认证机制防止重放攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1440","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=06256915.00591E18.00%40uprrsmtp2.notes.up.com","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5186","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b6911473cb9f3b7c6e3bfc931e2219f763048798/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0651.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0651","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/da07cb97146d03883b70ca493bde18a430b683ac/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0651.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9d5b2a1dce9c7e458934cecfd52fe64aaa62e247/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0651.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8fd24b26179bcdde52e301aef6d16b0838932c28/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wf72-vr87-m228/GHSA-wf72-vr87-m228.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0651.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0651.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f88adb2a-2f0f-4134-8725-fe9a851d7e83.json"],"po